    "markdown": "- **System Specifications:**\n  - Page frame size $= 16\\text{ bytes} = 2^4\\text{ bytes}$\n  - Memory capacity $= 4\\text{ page frames}$\n  - Given virtual addresses:\n    $$0, 4, 8, 20, 24, 36, 44, 12, 68, 72, 80, 84, 28, 32, 88, 92$$\n  - Page Number $= \\lfloor \\text{Address} / 16 \\rfloor$:\n    $$\\begin{array}{c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c}\n    \\text{Addr} & 0 & 4 & 8 & 20 & 24 & 36 & 44 & 12 & 68 & 72 & 80 & 84 & 28 & 32 & 88 & 92 \\\\\n    \\hline\n    \\text{Page} & 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1 & 2 & 2 & 0 & 4 & 4 & 5 & 5 & 1 & 2 & 5 & 5\n    \\end{array}$$\n\n- **Step-by-Step LRU Trace (Frames initially empty):**\n  - 1. Ref $0 \\implies$ **Page Fault 1**. Frames: $[0]$\n  - 2. Ref $0 \\implies$ Hit. Frames: $[0]$\n  - 3. Ref $0 \\implies$ Hit. Frames: $[0]$\n  - 4. Ref $1 \\implies$ **Page Fault 2**. Frames: $[0, 1]$\n  - 5. Ref $1 \\implies$ Hit. Frames: $[0, 1]$\n  - 6. Ref $2 \\implies$ **Page Fault 3**. Frames: $[0, 1, 2]$\n  - 7. Ref $2 \\implies$ Hit. Frames: $[0, 1, 2]$\n  - 8. Ref $0 \\implies$ Hit. Order: $[1, 2, 0]$\n  - 9. Ref $4 \\implies$ **Page Fault 4**. Frames: $[1, 2, 0, 4]$ (all 4 frames full)\n  - 10. Ref $4 \\implies$ Hit. Order: $[1, 2, 0, 4]$\n  - 11. Ref $5 \\implies$ **Page Fault 5**. Evicts LRU page $1$. Frames: $[2, 0, 4, 5]$\n  - 12. Ref $5 \\implies$ Hit. Order: $[2, 0, 4, 5]$\n  - 13. Ref $1 \\implies$ **Page Fault 6**. Evicts LRU page $2$. Frames: $[0, 4, 5, 1]$\n  - 14. Ref $2 \\implies$ **Page Fault 7**. Evicts LRU page $0$. Frames: $[4, 5, 1, 2]$\n  - 15. Ref $5 \\implies$ Hit. Order: $[4, 1, 2, 5]$\n  - 16. Ref $5 \\implies$ Hit. Order: $[4, 1, 2, 5]$\n\n- **Results:**\n  - Total Page Faults $= 7$\n  - Pages present in memory at completion $= \\{1, 2, 4, 5\\}$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is **Option B ($7$ and $1, 2, 4, 5$)**.",
